                    "features": [
                      {
                        "uri": "https://standard.site",
                        "$type": "pub.leaflet.richtext.facet#link"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ],
                "plaintext": "In the process we removed the publication-focused Discover page, which was less useful — maybe we'll revisit in some form (like a way to recommend pubs) but here we want posts to shine. This is also a fun area for global standard.site tools to explore!"
              }
            },
